    <description><![CDATA[<h2><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YD7lQLzVHMc-ds2mEH7OEg" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YD7lQLzVHMc-ds2mEH7OEg"><span>人生不是上下半场</span></a></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnaGe4li-3cdKkDAkncAgwyJs0lU.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>人生不是上下半场。</span></strong></p><span></span><h2><span>虽然“上下半场”这一比喻形象生动，但也过于简化，忽略了人生旅程中的丰富细节与多样风景。与其将人生分为足球赛一样的，上下半场，不如将其比作一场四节的篮球赛，每一节都承担着不同的任务与挑战，共同编织出多彩的人生画卷。</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm1c2dAIlhL9buoG_hbKjUrAReJq.png"></figure><span></span><h2><span>要找到自己的</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/664d4bb7c59d1e5757cf8cb5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/664d4bb7c59d1e5757cf8cb5"><span>配速</span></a><span>。</span></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>第一节--学生时代</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第二节--毕业到中年</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第三节--中年到退休</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>第四节--退休以后</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtHMjOvmRGuD-cZchg26uBHKJ5Fn.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llbmZxQG0u_zzkrYuZbSNlfELMdb.m4a" length="6695274" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:06:53</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg8Ec8uhqs3yBiFAKKqHWfWdWB2M.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
